KH.tc_ko_-0037_99_99_0010","sourceRecordId":"tc_ko_-0037_99_99_0010","year":-37,"calendar":"unspecified","precision":"year","originalDate":"-0037-99-99","title":"왕경에 성(城)을 쌓고 금성(金城)이라 함.","body":"왕경에 성(城)을 쌓고 금성(金城)이라 함.삼국사기 신라본기","collectionId":"tcko","sourceUrl":"https://db.history.go.kr/id/tcko_-0037_99_99_0010","sourceLinkType":"article","originalMetadataUrl":"http://db.history.go.kr/url.jsp?ID=tc_ko_-0037_99_99_0010"},{"id":"KH.NIKH.tc_ko_-0037_99_99_0020","sourceRecordId":"tc_ko_-0037_99_99_0020","year":-37,"calendar":"unspecified","precision":"year","originalDate":"-0037-99-99","title":"주몽(朱夢) 즉위하여 국호를 고구려라함.","body":"주몽(朱夢) 즉위하여 국호를 고구려라함. 동명성왕 비류국(沸流國) 송양(宋讓)과 활쏘기를 겨룸.삼국사기 신라본기:고구려본기","collectionId":"tcko","sourceUrl":"https://db.history.go.kr/id/tcko_-0037_99_99_0020","sourceLinkType":"article","originalMetadataUrl":"http://db.history.go.kr/url.jsp?ID=tc_ko_-0037_99_99_0020"},{"id":"KH.NIKH.tc_ko_-0036_06_99_0010","sourceRecordId":"tc_ko_-0036_06_99_0010","year":-36,"calendar":"unspecified","precision":"month","originalDate":"-0036-06-99","title":"송양이 항복해 옴에 그곳을 다물도(多勿都)라함.","body":"송양이 항복해 옴에 그곳을 다물도(多勿都)라함.삼국사기 고구려본기","collectionId":"tcko","sourceUrl":"https://db.history.go.kr/id/tcko_-0036_06_99_0010","sourceLinkType":"article","originalMetadataUrl":"http://db.history.go.kr/url.jsp?ID=tc_ko_-0036_06_99_0010"},{"id":"KH.NIKH.tc_ko_-0035_03_99_0010","sourceRecordId":"tc_ko_-0035_03_99_0010","year":-35,"calendar":"unspecified","precision":"month","originalDate":"-0035-03-99","title":"황룡(黃龍)이 골령(鶻嶺)에 나타남.","body":"황룡(黃龍)이 골령(鶻嶺)에 나타남.삼국사기 신라본기","collectionId":"tcko","sourceUrl":"https://db.history.go.kr/id/tcko_-0035_03_99_0010","sourceLinkType":"article","originalMetadataUrl":"http://db.history.go.kr/url.jsp?ID=tc_ko_-0035_03_99_0010"},{"id":"KH.NIKH.tc_ko_-0035_07_99_0010","sourceRecordId":"tc_ko_-0035_07_99_0010","year":-35,"calendar":"unspecified","precision":"month","originalDate":"-0035-07-99","title":"상서로운 구름이 골령에 나타남.","body":"상서로운 구름이 골령에 나타남.삼국사기 